---
const phases = [
  { label: 'Phase 1 · Foundation · Days 1–14',  body: 'What moves: your form stops leaking reps. Grip and base built so the bar stops slipping.' },
  { label: 'Phase 2 · Volume · Days 15–28',     body: 'What moves: your endurance ceiling. The sets push you to the wall so your body has a reason to break past it.' },
  { label: 'Phase 3 · Strength · Days 29–42',   body: 'What moves: raw power. Weighted work that makes bodyweight reps feel light.' },
  { label: 'Phase 4 · Peak + Test · Days 43–60', body: 'What moves: the number on the wall. Taper, peak, then film your new max on Day 58.' },
];

const beats = [
  { name: 'Monday Drop',   tag: null,   body: "your week's training lands. You always know exactly what to do." },
  { name: 'Form Check',    tag: 'Wed',  body: 'film one working set, send it. I find what\'s breaking.' },
  { name: 'Progress Check', tag: 'Sat', body: 'log your top set. Watch the number move, week by week.' },
];
---

<section class="bg-black py-16 md:py-24" aria-label="The 60 days">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl">

    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">The 60 Days</p>
    <h2 class="headline text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
      Every phase moves one thing
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-6 text-base text-bone sm:text-lg">
      No guessing what to do each week. Four phases, and you know exactly what each one is moving.
    </p>

    <!-- Phase arc -->
    <ul class="mt-10 space-y-5">
      {phases.map(({ label, body }) => (
        <li>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sand">{label}</p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-base text-bone">{body}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <!-- Weekly rhythm -->
    <div class="mt-14 border-t border-white/10 pt-10">
      <h3 class="headline text-3xl sm:text-4xl">
        Every week looks the same
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-bone">
        One I send. Two you send back.
      </p>

      <ul class="mt-8 space-y-5">
        {beats.map(({ name, tag, body }) => (
          <li>
            <p class="font-display text-lg uppercase tracking-display text-sand">
              {name}{tag && <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-stone">· {tag}</span>}
            </p>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-base text-bone">{body}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-stone">
        Those two Checks are your weekly Missions. Same rhythm every week, no guessing.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
